*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
